@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Crear Idioma en Catálogo (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/languages
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alemán"
}

### Listar Idiomas en Catálogo
GET {{baseUrl}}/languages
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Asignar Idioma y Nivel al Alumno (Alumno autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/languages/languageUsers
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languageId": "LANGUAGE_UUID_HERE",
  "skillId": "SKILL_UUID_HERE"
}

### Eliminar Idioma de un Alumno (Alumno propietario)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/languages/languageUsers/RELATION_UUID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}
